WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:02.820
<i>A chicken race.</i>

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.530
<i>A game of speed in which 
competitors charge at an obstacle</i>

00:00:06.530 --> 00:00:09.200
<i>at full speed, dodging only at the last second,</i>

00:00:09.200 --> 00:00:10.790
<i>to demonstrate courage.</i>

00:00:12.190 --> 00:00:17.200
<i>And right now, she has been chosen as 
the obstacle in this dangerous game.</i>

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:20.100
Oh, boy! Here they come, here they come!

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.850
K-Kazuma, this time... 
this time I'm surely done for!

00:00:23.850 --> 00:00:26.170
Oh, they're gonna ram me!

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:38.700
Kazuma! Do you suppose this 
counts as a type of teasing?

00:00:38.700 --> 00:00:41.180
This sensation of almost being 
struck is quite something!

00:00:41.570 --> 00:00:46.850
Unbelievable. Males in heat are 
leaping over me, one after another!

00:00:47.150 --> 00:00:50.520
Stop it! There are people watching! 
Don't say another word!

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:05.670
<b>KONOSUBA!
God's Blessing on this Wonderful World! 2</b>

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:25.010
<b>Episode 8  Sightseeing in This Pitiful City!</b>

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:23.490
Blessing!

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:27.370
Oh, don't bother with me!

00:02:30.560 --> 00:02:32.530
We shouldn't need to worry 
about Darkness now.

00:02:32.530 --> 00:02:34.510
All thanks to my Blessing!

00:02:34.510 --> 00:02:35.610
Yeah, yeah.

00:02:35.610 --> 00:02:37.740
When we're done here, you can have my seat.

00:02:37.740 --> 00:02:38.550
Yes!

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:40.630
Lightning!

00:02:40.630 --> 00:02:42.510
Blade of Wind!

00:02:42.750 --> 00:02:44.010
Fireball!

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:58.730
They're still coming?!

00:02:58.730 --> 00:02:59.740
All right!

00:03:02.580 --> 00:03:04.950
Pops, are there any cliffs around here?!

00:03:04.950 --> 00:03:06.270
Nothing of the sort!

00:03:06.270 --> 00:03:08.750
Closest thing is a cave we use 
for shelter from the heat!

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:11.620
A cave? That works! Take us there!

00:03:11.830 --> 00:03:13.880
Megumin, Aqua! Get in the wagon!

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.750
Come on, Darkness—

00:03:16.730 --> 00:03:18.890
So heavy... Can't lift...

00:03:18.890 --> 00:03:21.270
Don't say I'm heavy!

00:03:21.270 --> 00:03:23.760
You have to specify that 
my <i>armor</i> is too heavy!

00:03:24.230 --> 00:03:28.160
Just tie me to the wagon with 
a rope and drag me along.

00:03:28.160 --> 00:03:30.010
It's an emergency! No way around it!

00:03:30.010 --> 00:03:32.350
Don't hold back! You have no choice!

00:03:33.510 --> 00:03:35.110
Sir, you'd better hurry!

00:03:35.110 --> 00:03:36.860
We can't wait much longer!

00:03:37.480 --> 00:03:39.330
Let me know if it's too much, Darkness!

00:03:39.330 --> 00:03:40.820
We'll let you loose!

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:44.930
Being tied to a cart and dragged by horses...

00:03:44.930 --> 00:03:48.080
Not only that, but while in that state, 
I'll be chased by a bunch of lus—

00:04:00.350 --> 00:04:02.550
Kazuma! This is good! So good!

00:04:01.150 --> 00:04:03.160
Don't yell my name in that context!

00:04:02.550 --> 00:04:05.340
It's a new discovery, 
being treated as luggage like this!

00:04:05.910 --> 00:04:09.930
I knew you were a brute, Kazuma, 
but this might be going too far...

00:04:11.160 --> 00:04:14.440
I-It wasn't my idea! It was Darkness!

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:17.860
Sir, they're gonna catch us at this rate!

00:04:19.040 --> 00:04:21.120
Crap! Pops, how far to the cave?

00:04:21.120 --> 00:04:22.120
Need more time!

00:04:22.120 --> 00:04:23.860
We're done for!

00:04:24.400 --> 00:04:26.120
Bottomless Swamp!

00:04:32.490 --> 00:04:34.080
Thanks, Wiz!

00:04:37.250 --> 00:04:41.470
For a noble to be in such 
a disheveled state...

00:04:41.470 --> 00:04:43.810
No! Stop it! Don't look, Kazuma!

00:04:43.810 --> 00:04:48.760
Don't look at the seedy sight 
of me being treated so roughly!

00:04:48.760 --> 00:04:51.960
Heal! Heal! Heal! Heal! Heal!

00:04:51.960 --> 00:04:53.640
Darkness! Hang in there!

00:04:53.640 --> 00:04:56.270
Kazuma! The cave is within sight!

00:04:56.270 --> 00:04:58.850
I'm ready to fire my magic anytime!

00:04:58.850 --> 00:04:59.770
All right!

00:04:59.990 --> 00:05:02.550
Pops, stop the wagon to the 
side of the cave's opening!

00:05:02.550 --> 00:05:03.050
Okay!

00:05:03.050 --> 00:05:05.860
Aqua, I need support magic 
to boost my strength!

00:05:06.120 --> 00:05:07.310
Got it!

00:05:07.310 --> 00:05:08.370
Powered!

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:16.130
Snipe! Snipe! Snipe! Snipe!

00:05:26.740 --> 00:05:28.290
<i>I see...</i>

00:05:28.290 --> 00:05:30.430
<i>And I was starting to 
wonder just what made</i>

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:32.460
<i>these Running Hawk Kites 
"kites" of any kind.</i>

00:05:32.460 --> 00:05:33.520
<i>That clears it up.</i>

00:05:33.890 --> 00:05:36.920
Hang on tight, folks!

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:37.850
Got it!

00:06:01.040 --> 00:06:03.600
Not bad! This treatment isn't bad at all!

00:06:03.600 --> 00:06:07.360
I should've expected as much from Kazuma! 
Roughed up and then used as monster bait—

00:06:12.750 --> 00:06:13.640
Megumin!

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:15.640
Explosion!

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:30.530
Now, everyone, eat up!

00:06:30.530 --> 00:06:32.330
This turned out great, so help yourself!

00:06:32.330 --> 00:06:34.160
I have to say, that was impressive!

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:38.720
To think you had a magic user powerful 
enough to use explosion magic!

00:06:38.720 --> 00:06:43.250
And an arch priest able to treat all 
the injured with no trouble!

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:46.000
Facing down that pack of Running Hawk Kites

00:06:46.000 --> 00:06:49.520
without backing down, all on her own! 
Such a courageous crusader!

00:06:49.520 --> 00:06:52.800
And being able to used advanced magic 
to slow them down with that swamp magic!

00:06:52.980 --> 00:06:57.290
Not to mention the inspired decision to 
lure the enemy into the cave so that

00:06:57.290 --> 00:06:59.180
they could be dealt with all at once!

00:06:59.170 --> 00:07:01.190
I am quite impressed!

00:07:01.190 --> 00:07:03.240
<i>Please stop, seriously.</i>

00:07:03.240 --> 00:07:06.320
<i>It's not like that at all. This is our fault.</i>

00:07:06.520 --> 00:07:09.300
This is just to show my 
gratitude. Here, please.

00:07:09.300 --> 00:07:12.300
No, no, no, no! It's totally fine! Really!

00:07:12.300 --> 00:07:14.180
What are you saying?

00:07:14.180 --> 00:07:17.080
It was your group that defeated 
the Running Hawk Kites!

00:07:17.650 --> 00:07:20.410
As adventurers, it's only natural 
we contribute to the battle.

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:22.730
Remarkable!

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:27.380
To think that true adventurers like you 
people still exist in this harsh world!

00:07:28.150 --> 00:07:31.430
<i>I can't accept a reward 
for a problem we caused!</i>

00:07:31.700 --> 00:07:32.680
KONOSUBA!

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:34.260
Can you pull it off?!

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:44.620
Thank you, thank you!

00:07:59.760 --> 00:08:02.020
You guys are making this very awkward.

00:08:02.020 --> 00:08:05.480
Nah, I was just impressed 
with how well you were doing.

00:08:05.950 --> 00:08:09.570
Something about seeing my 
armor being repaired first-hand

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:11.100
is exciting to watch.

00:08:11.100 --> 00:08:15.420
I'm glad the smithing skills I learned 
for product development came in handy.

00:08:16.300 --> 00:08:18.620
Again! Do that trick again!

00:08:18.620 --> 00:08:21.180
I'll pay if I have to! 
So please, one more time!

00:08:22.390 --> 00:08:25.550
She could probably make a living 
doing this sort of thing.

00:08:42.930 --> 00:08:45.540
Hey, wake up, Megumin! Something's weird!

00:08:48.170 --> 00:08:51.230
Hey! Megumin, Wiz, wake up!

00:08:51.230 --> 00:08:54.240
Otherwise I'm gonna do something that'll 
make it hard to look me in the eye...

00:08:54.240 --> 00:08:56.050
You don't mind? It's fine, then?

00:08:56.290 --> 00:08:57.750
Of course it's not!

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:59.450
What were you going to do?

00:09:00.390 --> 00:09:02.270
Hey, don't scare me like that!

00:09:02.270 --> 00:09:05.800
I was about to do something 
crazy in front of you!

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:08.400
Seriously, what were you going to do?

00:09:08.640 --> 00:09:10.280
No, that's not important now.

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:12.030
Hey, there's something out there!

00:09:12.030 --> 00:09:13.780
Everyone, wake up!

00:09:17.340 --> 00:09:19.240
And... Foresight.

00:09:23.400 --> 00:09:26.370
There's a lot of them! 
But they're moving stiffly...

00:09:36.520 --> 00:09:39.350
Handle things here! I'll get Aqua!

00:09:39.670 --> 00:09:41.870
<i>Now's our chance to pay everyone back!</i>

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:45.320
<i>After the trouble we caused when the Running 
Hawk Kites were attracted to Darkness—</i>

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:50.850
What is this?! Why am I surrounded 
by undead the second I wake up?!

00:09:50.850 --> 00:09:53.610
Kazuma-san! Kazuma-san!

00:09:53.950 --> 00:09:56.900
Wait. Is this...

00:09:57.540 --> 00:10:00.870
Trying to attack us while we sleep?! 
Pretty sneaky of you, undead!

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:03.640
Oh, wandering souls, rest in peace!

00:10:03.640 --> 00:10:05.270
Turn Undead!

00:10:18.150 --> 00:10:19.300
Hang in there, Wiz!

00:10:19.700 --> 00:10:20.860
Someone! Wiz is...

00:10:20.860 --> 00:10:23.060
Amazing! She got all those zombies at once!

00:10:23.060 --> 00:10:24.120
Awesome!

00:10:24.990 --> 00:10:25.810
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:29.780
Your luck ran out when you ran into me!

00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:32.060
Now, I'll purify every last one of you!

00:10:33.430 --> 00:10:34.570
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:10:34.860 --> 00:10:37.140
Such a beautiful priest!

00:10:37.140 --> 00:10:39.090
She's like a goddess!

00:10:39.090 --> 00:10:42.320
She's from that crusader's party!

00:10:42.650 --> 00:10:44.820
<i>I'm sorry. I'm so sorry.</i>

00:10:44.820 --> 00:10:47.450
<i>I'm so sorry for everything 
my friends keep causing.</i>

00:10:47.720 --> 00:10:50.710
It's pretty rare to see a 
pack of attacking zombies.

00:10:50.710 --> 00:10:53.960
Good thing we had that priest with us!

00:10:54.530 --> 00:10:56.140
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

00:10:56.140 --> 00:10:57.950
<i>If our goddess wasn't here,</i>

00:10:57.950 --> 00:11:01.100
<i>these zombies probably wouldn't 
have shown up in the first place.</i>

00:11:02.320 --> 00:11:05.510
Well, Kazuma? Was that goddess-like or what?

00:11:05.510 --> 00:11:08.250
I have to say, I have been 
really nailing it lately!

00:11:08.250 --> 00:11:12.730
It wouldn't kill you to 
make an offering, y'know!

00:11:12.950 --> 00:11:15.370
Wow, you've saved us again!

00:11:15.370 --> 00:11:18.240
This time, please, accept this reward!

00:11:18.240 --> 00:11:21.650
I'm sorry! We absolutely can not accept!

00:11:23.160 --> 00:11:25.580
Can you wrap this up as a gift?

00:11:25.580 --> 00:11:26.620
Sure thing.

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:29.540
E-Excuse me!

00:11:29.540 --> 00:11:32.750
W-We're finally going to duel today, Megumin!

00:11:32.750 --> 00:11:35.640
This is just a little something from me! 
You can all enjoy it together!

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:39.800
H-Hello?

00:11:47.370 --> 00:11:49.310
Hey, look over there!

00:12:07.540 --> 00:12:11.950
We're here! The city of water 
and hot springs, Arcanretia!

00:12:26.630 --> 00:12:28.760
Wow! Elves and dwarves!

00:12:29.130 --> 00:12:31.030
Now this is really fantastical!

00:12:32.030 --> 00:12:34.720
The scenery is completely 
different from Axel...

00:12:37.350 --> 00:12:39.020
And the air is so clean.

00:12:39.450 --> 00:12:42.150
Steamed buns! Care for a steamed bun?

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:45.160
Those are a local specialty, Arcan steamed buns.

00:12:45.160 --> 00:12:47.200
They're supposed to be quite tasty!

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:48.910
I'm impressed you know that, Megumin.

00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:53.610
Arcanretia is famous among 
adventurers as a health resort.

00:12:53.610 --> 00:12:56.670
The curative effects of the hot springs 
here are said to be extraordinary!

00:12:56.890 --> 00:12:58.060
Yeah?

00:12:58.060 --> 00:13:02.150
My father took me to several 
different towns in the past,

00:13:02.150 --> 00:13:04.680
but this place is more 
beautiful than any of them.

00:13:05.370 --> 00:13:07.180
This should be a good hot springs trip.

00:13:08.120 --> 00:13:12.210
If they're all like this, maybe we should've 
been visiting different towns all this time.

00:13:13.830 --> 00:13:16.400
Well, enjoy your holiday, folks!

00:13:16.400 --> 00:13:18.590
Thanks, Pops!

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.730
Aww... Jarippa.

00:13:21.730 --> 00:13:23.860
Jarippa is being taken away!

00:13:24.390 --> 00:13:27.260
She gave something a 
weird name again...

00:13:28.080 --> 00:13:30.390
Come on, everyone! Where should we go?

00:13:30.390 --> 00:13:32.630
You can ask me anything you 
need to know about this town!

00:13:32.630 --> 00:13:36.920
After all, this town is the home of 
the Axis Church, which I've blessed!

00:13:38.140 --> 00:13:41.550
<i>As in... the Axis cult 
that's full of weirdos?</i>

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:43.980
<i>And this is town is its home?</i>

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:47.870
<i>That explains why Aqua wanted to come here.</i>

00:13:49.170 --> 00:13:51.660
Welcome to Arcanretia!

00:13:51.660 --> 00:13:55.040
Are you tourists? Converts? 
Adventurers? Pilgrims?

00:13:55.040 --> 00:13:58.530
If you've come looking for work, 
might I recommend the Axis Church?

00:13:58.530 --> 00:14:01.440
We have a job right now where you can 
get paid just to tell other towns

00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:03.320
about how wonderful the Axis Church is!

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:04.710
If you accept the position,

00:14:04.710 --> 00:14:07.570
you get the bonus of being able to identify 
yourself as part of the Axis Church!

00:14:07.800 --> 00:14:09.820
How about it? Please, join us!

00:14:10.390 --> 00:14:13.330
Such beautiful light blue hair!

00:14:13.610 --> 00:14:16.690
Is it natural? I'm jealous! 
I'm ever so jealous!

00:14:16.690 --> 00:14:20.080
Your raiment is just like 
Aqua-sama's, too! It suits you!

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:22.990
W-We should probably 
head to an inn for now.

00:14:22.990 --> 00:14:25.090
R-Right. Good idea.

00:14:25.340 --> 00:14:28.300
We've already got a priest from 
the Axis cult with us, so...

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:29.710
Pardon us!

00:14:30.340 --> 00:14:34.720
Farewell, comrades! And may 
you have a blessed day!

00:14:34.900 --> 00:14:36.230
KONOSUBA!

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:45.730
Hey!

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:48.120
Hey!

00:14:55.000 --> 00:14:58.500
Come on! Come over here!

00:15:01.600 --> 00:15:03.080
Where am I?

00:15:03.080 --> 00:15:06.460
Relax. We're already at Arcanretia.

00:15:07.110 --> 00:15:09.790
I feel as though I was on the 
edge of a beautiful river,

00:15:09.790 --> 00:15:12.890
and Verdia-san was happily waving 
to me from the other side...

00:15:15.180 --> 00:15:17.630
Thank you so much, Kazuma-san.

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:19.990
You should thank Darkness, not me.

00:15:19.990 --> 00:15:22.480
I'm glad you've made it back.

00:15:22.660 --> 00:15:27.230
I hope that Aqua hasn't 
caused some new problem.

00:15:27.400 --> 00:15:30.740
I'm gonna go have some fun at the 
headquarters of the Axis Church!

00:15:31.230 --> 00:15:34.240
Time to be fawned over for 
being an arch priest!

00:15:35.970 --> 00:15:37.510
I'm worried.

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:41.370
I'm sure it'll be fine. 
Megumin went with her.

00:15:41.610 --> 00:15:44.090
Really? You think so?

00:15:44.090 --> 00:15:46.040
I'm fine now,

00:15:46.040 --> 00:15:48.860
so why don't the two of you 
take a look around town?

00:15:48.860 --> 00:15:52.890
Let's go, Kazuma. I'd love 
to get a look at the city.

00:15:55.290 --> 00:15:57.950
Look, Kazuma! There's a fountain!

00:15:58.460 --> 00:16:00.060
Hey, you're right.

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:03.060
This statue of their goddess is beautiful...

00:16:03.300 --> 00:16:04.560
<i>And a sham.</i>

00:16:10.180 --> 00:16:11.730
My apples...

00:16:11.730 --> 00:16:12.850
Are you okay?

00:16:16.200 --> 00:16:17.950
Thank you so much!

00:16:17.950 --> 00:16:19.990
You've been a huge help!

00:16:20.600 --> 00:16:21.700
Um...

00:16:22.870 --> 00:16:26.090
Can I do anything to thank you?

00:16:26.090 --> 00:16:28.930
<i>Huh? Did I just trigger a flag?</i>

00:16:33.440 --> 00:16:36.950
There's a café run by the 
Axis Church just up ahead!

00:16:36.950 --> 00:16:38.970
Why don't we go there and have a chat?

00:16:38.970 --> 00:16:40.310
I'm good, thanks.

00:16:40.310 --> 00:16:42.350
W-W-Wait a second!

00:16:42.350 --> 00:16:44.380
I'm actually great at telling fortunes!

00:16:44.380 --> 00:16:46.420
Why don't you let me read your future?

00:16:46.420 --> 00:16:48.440
Th-That's quite all right!

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:50.690
Seriously, it's fine!

00:16:50.690 --> 00:16:52.910
L-Let go!

00:16:53.450 --> 00:16:54.250
Ow, ow, ow!

00:16:54.250 --> 00:16:56.310
I've seen your future!

00:16:56.310 --> 00:16:58.230
Grave misfortune awaits you!

00:16:58.230 --> 00:17:01.830
But if you convert to the Axis faith, 
your misfortune can be avoided!

00:17:01.830 --> 00:17:04.580
Join us! Why don't you join us?

00:17:05.070 --> 00:17:07.040
I'm experiencing misfortune 
at this very instant!

00:17:07.040 --> 00:17:08.850
Hey, let go!

00:17:08.850 --> 00:17:10.620
Darkness, save me!

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:11.710
I'm sorry.

00:17:12.100 --> 00:17:14.430
I'm actually a believer in the Eris faith.

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:17.540
If you want to proselytize to him, 
you'll have to wait until—

00:17:27.800 --> 00:17:30.050
W-Well, you know how it is.

00:17:30.050 --> 00:17:33.230
I know that the Axis cult and the 
Eris church don't get along too well...

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:35.020
Maybe you should keep your charm hidden.

00:17:35.020 --> 00:17:36.360
And don't let it bother you too—

00:17:38.760 --> 00:17:41.490
Are you turned on right now?

00:17:41.490 --> 00:17:42.620
I am not.

00:17:42.620 --> 00:17:44.250
But you just made that "Mmn!" sound.

00:17:46.950 --> 00:17:50.280
This place really is the 
home of the Axis cult.

00:17:50.280 --> 00:17:52.820
Well, there are fewer people around here,

00:17:52.820 --> 00:17:54.170
so we should be fine now.

00:17:54.170 --> 00:17:56.120
Eek! Help me!

00:17:56.120 --> 00:17:58.260
You there! Please, help me!

00:17:58.680 --> 00:18:01.350
This violent-looking man, 
who's probably an Eris cultist,

00:18:01.350 --> 00:18:04.410
is trying to force me into his dark ways!

00:18:05.050 --> 00:18:06.760
Hey, you there!

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:08.650
You're not with the Axis Church, are you?

00:18:09.510 --> 00:18:13.200
If you were as cool and strong as the members 
of that faith, I'd have to run away!

00:18:13.200 --> 00:18:15.150
But if you're not, I'm not gonna hold back!

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:17.490
I've received the blessing 
of the Dark Goddess Eris!

00:18:17.490 --> 00:18:20.690
If you wanna get in my way, 
then I'll let you have it!

00:18:20.690 --> 00:18:22.540
Oh, this is horrible!

00:18:22.540 --> 00:18:26.020
And all I have on me is the paperwork 
for joining the Axis Church!

00:18:26.020 --> 00:18:28.600
If only someone would sign their name,

00:18:28.600 --> 00:18:31.460
this sinister Eris cultist 
would flee in fear!

00:18:33.220 --> 00:18:35.910
Hey, wait, don't abandon me, sir!

00:18:35.910 --> 00:18:38.200
It's fine! You just have to 
write your name on this paper,

00:18:38.200 --> 00:18:40.320
and then you'll receive some 
kind power from Aqua-sama

00:18:40.320 --> 00:18:41.890
to make you strong and super cool!

00:18:41.890 --> 00:18:46.160
With that power, this Eris cultist will 
surely lose his nerve and run away!

00:18:46.160 --> 00:18:47.200
That's right!

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:49.830
Plus, if you join, you'll get 
all kinds of rare bonuses,

00:18:49.830 --> 00:18:52.110
like becoming a good entertainer

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:54.040
and being beloved by undead monsters!

00:18:54.040 --> 00:18:56.780
If you insist on calling Eris-sama 
a dark goddess in my presence—

00:19:02.820 --> 00:19:05.490
Is everyone in the Axis cult like this?

00:19:07.610 --> 00:19:11.000
<i>Everyone in the Eris cult better 
not be like her, either.</i>

00:19:10.990 --> 00:19:12.090
You were turned on, weren't you?

00:19:12.090 --> 00:19:12.750
Was not.

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:14.750
Congratulations!

00:19:14.750 --> 00:19:18.360
You are the millionth to 
pass down this street!

00:19:18.360 --> 00:19:21.310
I'd love to give you a commemorative 
prize, but you see,

00:19:21.310 --> 00:19:23.390
the prize is actually sponsored 
by the Axis Church,

00:19:23.650 --> 00:19:27.140
so if you'd just help me get 
this paperwork out of the way,

00:19:27.140 --> 00:19:30.640
we can get your name, and you 
can receive your prize...

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:34.230
Hey! Hey, wow, it's been so long!

00:19:34.230 --> 00:19:36.520
It's me! You know, me! How've you been?

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:39.120
Remember? We were classmates in school!

00:19:39.120 --> 00:19:41.780
We were in the same class! 
Do you remember me?

00:19:41.780 --> 00:19:45.310
I've changed a lot since 
joining the Axis Church,

00:19:45.310 --> 00:19:46.790
so maybe you didn't recognize me!

00:19:47.080 --> 00:19:48.540
Oh, my! Wait a moment!

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:51.250
Are you two newlyweds? Why, how darling!

00:19:51.250 --> 00:19:53.700
Here, take this detergent!

00:19:53.700 --> 00:19:55.780
Oh, don't worry about paying!

00:19:55.780 --> 00:19:57.800
It's a little wedding gift from an old lady!

00:19:58.040 --> 00:20:00.080
It's actually some amazing stuff!

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:03.760
I mean, it's received Aqua-sama's blessing,
so it can get rid of any kind of stain!

00:20:03.760 --> 00:20:06.760
And it's so easy on your skin! I'm serious!

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:10.140
You can even drink it!

00:20:14.640 --> 00:20:17.020
What is wrong with this town?

00:20:17.200 --> 00:20:19.680
A trial in a heretical land...

00:20:20.840 --> 00:20:22.190
What an experience!

00:20:22.790 --> 00:20:24.680
You never break character, do you?

00:20:25.160 --> 00:20:26.990
Here are your orders.

00:20:28.380 --> 00:20:30.910
Oh, and for our guest from the Eris cult...

00:20:31.380 --> 00:20:34.170
This is for you, on the house.

00:20:34.690 --> 00:20:36.530
Please enjoy yourselves.

00:20:39.320 --> 00:20:43.030
Hey, Kazuma, why don't 
we all move to this town?

00:20:43.030 --> 00:20:44.430
Absolutely not!

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:45.890
KONOSUBA!

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:51.450
Let's just head back to the inn.

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:59.070
Are you okay?

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:02.070
Here, let me see.

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:04.290
Looks like it's just a scratch.

00:21:04.290 --> 00:21:06.570
Thank you, mister, lady!

00:21:07.860 --> 00:21:10.610
<i>Even in a city full of religious nutcases,</i>

00:21:10.610 --> 00:21:13.330
<i>this girl blooms like a single flower!</i>

00:21:13.700 --> 00:21:14.400
Here.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:16.630
Well? Does it hurt?

00:21:16.630 --> 00:21:19.640
No, it's fine now! Thank you!

00:21:19.640 --> 00:21:22.840
Hey, nice man, tell me your name!

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:25.670
It's Kazuma. Satou Kazuma.

00:21:25.670 --> 00:21:27.890
And the scary lady here is Darkness.

00:21:27.890 --> 00:21:30.130
D-Don't give me such a weird introduction!

00:21:30.130 --> 00:21:33.400
Am I really that scary-looking?

00:21:34.570 --> 00:21:37.520
How do you write "Satou Kazuma"?

00:21:37.520 --> 00:21:39.110
Write it for me, mister!

00:21:39.480 --> 00:21:41.980
Sure. My name is written like—

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:54.500
Damn it all!

00:21:54.630 --> 00:22:01.010
Mister!

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:41.200
<b>Episode 9</b>

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:41.200
<b>A Goddess for This Corrupt Hot Springs Town!</b>

00:23:31.010 --> 00:23:41.240
<b>My dear friends, Funifura-san and Dodonko-san.
About coming to visit, please don't do it!
I'm sure you're busy, so don't put yourselves out on my behalf.
I'm actually pretty occupied myself, as well.
Is it all right if you wait a bit before coming by?
Please. Please, I beg for your patience.
-Yunyun</b>

00:23:32.280 --> 00:23:35.430
My dear friends, Funifura-san 
and Dodonko-san.

00:23:35.430 --> 00:23:38.890
About coming to visit, please don't do it!

00:23:38.890 --> 00:23:41.240
I'm sure you're busy, so don't—
